00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.690
DAN BELCHER: All right.

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:10.700
Good afternoon, everyone.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:12.060
Thank you for joining.

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:13.360
I'm Dan Belcher.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:16.840
I'm one of the founders of
a new startup called mabl.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:20.590
And this is Joe Lust,
one of our engineers.

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:22.730
First off, I want to
thank you for coming.

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:25.660
I know we're competing
