00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:27.860
with Diane Greene
and Jeff Deans.

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:31.330
So, you must all be as excited
about testing as I am, right?

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:31.830
Right?

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:32.361
Yeah, OK.

00:00:32.361 --> 00:00:32.860
Good.

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:34.570
Yeah, Woo-hoo!

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:38.950
So we're here to talk about
the future of software testing

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:42.100
and the relationship
